            "review_text": "Lis_M\nCali, Colombia55 contributions\n0\nBest Bánh Mì in Vietnam!\nMay 2024 • Friends\nI recently had the pleasure of visit Banh Mi Bà Ry and it's by far the best I've tried in Vietnam! The flavors were expertly balanced, the bread was crispy and fresh, and the fillings were generous and savory plus the portion is big!\n\nThe staff were friendly and attentive, and the service was quick and efficient.\n\nI'll definitely be back!\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2024\nBánh Mì BÀ RY I Madam Ry\nThank you so much for the glowing review! 🌟\nWe’re truly honored to hear that Bánh Mì Bà Ry is the best you’ve tried in Vietnam!\nYour kind words about the crispy bread, savory fillings, generous portion, and quick, friendly service mean the world to us.\nWe’re so happy you had a great experience — and we’ll be more than ready to welcome you back for another delicious bánh mì soon! 🥖💛\nFrom all of us at Bà Ry: Cảm ơn bạn rất nhiều! 🙏✨\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
