            "review_text": "Passenger46777656204\n1 contribution\n0\nThis Banh Mi Is Powerful!\nApr 2024 • Couples\nMy partner and i arrived here at noon, and were greeted with great customer service. We sat outside in the garden area where it was nice, spacious and airy with a fan blowing.\n\nWe enjoyed an incredible Banh Mi Saigon style (it's a much bigger Banh Mi than usual that you get for your money)\n\nHighly highly recommended to go and try here, especially if you're from the west and enjoy the bigger portion sizes!\n\nThe larger one we got was actually enough to split it in half for both myself and my partner - 2 for the price of 1!\n\nDon't worry, if it's too big to finish they'll wrap it up for you to take away no problem.\n\nYou can also order and have it delivered by calling them directly or by grab.\n\nOverall the Banh Mi was amazing and you should definitely come here to experience it.\n\nWill be back - A++.\n\nP.S The drinks were also incredible. We got a Vietnamese egg coffee & a strawberry and mango smoothie. Again, pick either 2 of them up...they were great!\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2024\nBánh Mì BÀ RY I Madam Ry\nThank you so much for your incredibly thoughtful and detailed review! 🙏✨\nWe’re thrilled to hear that you and your partner had such a great experience with our Saigon-style Banh Mi at Bánh Mì Bà Ry. Your kind words truly made our day!\n📌 Highlights from your experience:\n • The extra-large Banh Mi was satisfying enough to split between two people — “2 for the price of 1!”\n • The outdoor garden seating with fans made it a relaxing place to enjoy your meal.\n • Our team is so glad you appreciated the friendly service and the option to wrap leftovers to go.\n • Your shoutout for our drinks — especially the Strawberry-Mango Smoothie — means a lot!\n💬 “Highly highly recommended” — your enthusiastic words give us even more motivation to keep doing our best.\nWe look forward to welcoming you again soon!\nA++ from you = A+++ effort from us 💛🥖☕🍓🥭\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
